{"html":"<div class=\"product_detail\">\n<div align=\"center\" class=\"pdt_detail_img\">\n<img alt=\"제품 상세 공지(탑) - 온라인 가품 유통 주의 안내\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoopm.com/shop/storage/shop_image/Ww8yREXDVplPHT9vZS1WKnZe1DiprZ143KbzqknD.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n<div align=\"center\" class=\"pdt_detail_img\" style=\"padding:10px;\"><br/><br/><br/></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pdt_detail_img\">\n<style type=\"text/css\">.Product_detail_page h1, h2, h3, h4, h5, h6, ul, ol, li, dl, dt, dd, p, form, fieldset, input, table, tr, th, td, button, textarea {margin:0;padding:0;}\r\n.Product_detail_page {\r\n\twidth: 100%;\r\n\tmax-width:1200px; \r\n\tmargin: 0 auto; \r\n\tpadding: 0; \r\n\tfont-family: ''Noto Sans KR'', sans-serif;\r\n\ttext-align: center;\r\n\tfont-weight: 400;\r\n\tletter-spacing: -0.05em;\r\n\tword-break: keep-all;\r\n}\r\n.Product_detail_page p {\r\n\tcolor: #666;\r\n\tfont-weight: 400;\r\n\tfont-size: 22px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.Product_key_img {\r\n\tposition: relative;\r\n\theight: 1614px;\r\n}\r\n.Product_key_img img {width: 100%;}\r\n.Product_key_txt {\r\n\tposition: absolute;\r\n\ttext-align: left;\r\n\twidth: 100%;\r\n\tmargin-top: 9%;\r\n\tmargin-left: 2%;\r\n}\r\n.Product_key_txt h1, .Product_key_txt p {\r\n\tcolor: #343434;\r\n\tfont-size: 25px;\r\n\twidth: 55%;\r\n}\r\n.Product_key_txt .p01 {\r\n\ttext-transform: uppercase;\r\n\tfont-size: 15px;\r\n\tfont-weight: 600;\r\n\tletter-spacing: 0.2em;\r\n\tmargin-top: 1%;\r\n}\r\n.Product_key_txt .p02 {\r\n\tmargin-top: 1.2%;\r\n\tfont-weight: 600;\r\n}\r\n.Product_key_txt h1 {\r\n\twidth: 55%;\r\n\tfont-size: 80px;\r\n\tmargin-top: 5%;\r\n\tfont-weight: 700;\r\n\tcolor: #686767;\r\n}\r\n.Product_detail_page h3 {\r\n\tfont-weight: 600;\r\n\tfont-size: 50px;\r\n\ttext-align: center;\r\n\tcolor: #000;\r\n}\r\n.Product_detail_page h3 span {\r\n\tfont-weight: 300;\r\n}\r\n.Product_detail_page h5 {\r\n\tfont-weight: 600;\r\n\tfont-size: 20px;\r\n\ttext-transform: uppercase;\r\n\tcolor: #000;\r\n}\r\n.Product_detail_page .p04 {\r\n\tfont-weight: 500;\r\n\tmargin-top: 2%;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n.Product_detail_page .sub_head {\r\n\tposition: relative;\r\n}\r\n.Product_detail_page .subheading {\r\n\tposition: absolute;\r\n\twidth: 100%;\r\n\tmargin-top: 1%;\r\n}\r\n.Product_detail_page .subheading h5 {\r\n\tfont-weight: 600;\r\n\tfont-size: 20px;\r\n}\r\n.Product_detail_page .sub_head img {\r\n\twidth: 6%;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n.point_content {\r\n\twidth: 100%;\r\n\tpadding: 10% 0;\r\n}\r\n.point_content .content {\r\n\twidth: 85%;\r\n\tmargin: 0 auto;\r\n\ttext-align: center;\r\n}\r\n.icon_content {\r\n\twidth: 100%;\r\n}\r\n.icon_content .group01 {\r\n\tmargin-top: 7%;\r\n}\r\n.icon_content .sub_group {\r\n\tdisplay: inline-block;\r\n\twidth: 32%;\r\n\tvertical-align: top;\r\n}\r\n.icon_content .sub_group img {\r\n\twidth: 100%;\r\n}\r\n.icon_content .sub_group .icon_box {\r\n\twidth: 70%;\r\n\tmargin: 0 auto;\r\n}\r\n.icon_content .sub_group .txt {\r\n\tmargin-top: 5%;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n.key_point {\r\n\twidth: 100%;\r\n\tpadding-top: 10%;\r\n}\r\n.key_point h3 {\r\n\tmargin-bottom: 3%;\r\n}\r\n.point_content .main_content {\r\n\ttext-align: left;\r\n\tborder-bottom: 1px solid #c2c2c2;\r\n}\r\n.main_content01 {\r\n}\r\n.main_content01 .contents_img {\r\n\tdisplay: inline-block;\r\n\twidth: 45%;\r\n\tvertical-align: middle;\r\n}\r\n.main_content01 .contents_img img {\r\n\twidth: 100%;\r\n}\r\n.main_content01 .contents_txt {\r\n\tdisplay: inline-block;\r\n\twidth: 50%;\r\n\tmargin-left: 3%;\r\n\tvertical-align: middle;\r\n}\r\n.main_content01 .sub_tit {}\r\n.main_content01 .sub_tit .check, .sub_tit .tit {\r\n\tdisplay: inline-block;\r\n\tvertical-align: top;\r\n}\r\n.main_content01 .sub_tit .check img {\r\n\twidth: 100%;\r\n}\r\n.main_content01 .sub_tit .check {\r\n\twidth: 7%;\r\n\tmargin-top: 1%;\r\n}\r\n.main_content01 .sub_tit .tit {\r\n\twidth: 90%;\r\n\tfont-size: 35px;\r\n\tfont-weight: 600;\r\n\tline-height: 40px;\r\n\tcolor: #333;\r\n\tmargin-bottom: 2%;\r\n}\r\n.main_content01 .contents_txt .txt {\r\n\tmargin-top: 3%;\r\n}\r\n.point_content span.line {\r\n\tborder-bottom: 1px solid;\r\n\tfont-weight: 500;\r\n}\r\n.point_content p.small {\r\n\tfont-size: 20px;\r\n\tline-height: 27px;\r\n}\r\n.main_content01 .txt p {\r\n\tmargin-top: 2%;\r\n}\r\n.point_content .bd_none {\r\n\tborder: none;\r\n}\r\n.point_content .pd05 {\r\n\tpadding: 5% 0;\r\n}\r\n.point_content .pdt05 {\r\n\tpadding-top: 5%;\r\n}\r\n.point_content .bdn {\r\n\tborder-bottom: none;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n/**제품 주요성분**/\r\n.main_ingredient {\r\n\ttext-align: center;\r\n}\r\n.main_ingredient .content {\r\n\twidth: 90%;\r\n\tmargin: 0 auto;\r\n\tpadding: 5% 0;\r\n}\r\n.ingredient {\r\n\ttext-align: left;\r\n}\r\n.ingredient_img, .ingredient_txt, .ingredient_txt_R {\r\n\tdisplay: inline-block;\r\n\tvertical-align: middle;\r\n}\r\n.ingredient_img {\r\n\twidth: 18%;\r\n}\r\n.ingredient_txt {\r\n\twidth: 78%;\r\n\tmargin-left: 3%;\r\n}\r\n.ingredient_img img {\r\n\twidth: 100%;\r\n}\r\n.ingredient_txt .ingredient_tit, .ingredient_txt_R .ingredient_tit {\r\n\tfont-size: 25px;\r\n\tfont-weight: 500;\r\n\tcolor: #403025;\r\n\tborder-bottom: 1px solid;\r\n\tdisplay: inline-block;\r\n}\r\n.ingredient_R {\r\n\ttext-align: right;\r\n}\r\n.ingredient_txt_R {\r\n\twidth: 78%;\r\n\tmargin-right: 3%;\r\n}\r\n.ingredient_txt p, .ingredient_txt_R p {\r\n\tfont-size: 20px;\r\n\tfont-weight: 400;\r\n\tline-height: 28px;\r\n\tcolor: #666666;\r\n\tmargin-top: 1.5%;\r\n}\r\n.main_ingredient .content .bdb {\r\n\twidth: 85%;\r\n\theight: 1px;\r\n\tmargin: 0 auto;\r\n\tmargin-top: -1px;\r\n\tmargin-bottom: -2px;\r\n\tbackground-color: #e5e5e5;\r\n}\r\n.main_ingredient .fix_txt {\r\n\tfont-size: 20px;\r\n\tfont-weight: 400;\r\n\tmargin-top: 5%;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n/**제품부원료**/\r\n\r\n.sub_material {\r\n\twidth: 100%;\r\n\tmargin-bottom: 7%;\r\n}\r\n.sub_material .content {\r\n\twidth: 90%;\r\n\tmargin: 0 auto;\r\n\tmargin-top: 3%;\r\n}\r\n.sub_material .content img {\r\n\twidth: 100%;\r\n}\r\n.sub_material .group01, .sub_material .group02 {\r\n\tdisplay: inline-block;\r\n\tvertical-align: bottom;\r\n}\r\n.sub_material .group01 {\r\n\twidth: 18%;\r\n}\r\n.sub_material .group02 {\r\n\twidth: 75%;\r\n}\r\n.sub_material .group02 .sub_group {\r\n\tmargin-top: 2%;\r\n}\r\n.sub_material .box_img {\r\n\twidth: 70%;\r\n\tmargin: 0 auto;\r\n}\r\n.sub_material .box {\r\n\tdisplay: inline-block;\r\n}\r\n.sub_material .box .box_txt p {\r\n\tfont-weight: 600;\r\n\tcolor: #403025;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n/*point03*/\r\n.point03 {\r\n\twidth: 100%;\r\n}\r\n.Product_detail_page .point03 h5 {\r\n\tfont-weight: 600;\r\n\tfont-size: 40px;\r\n}\r\n.Product_detail_page .point03 .subheading {\r\n\tmargin-top: 0;\r\n}\r\n.point03 img {\r\n\twidth: 100%;\r\n}\r\n.point03 p.sub {\r\n\tmargin-top: 2%;\r\n\tmargin-bottom: 5%;\r\n}\r\n.point03 .content {\r\n\twidth: 100%;\r\n\tposition: relative;\r\n}\r\n.point03 .content .txt_box {\r\n\twidth: 37%;\r\n\tbackground-color: rgba( 255, 255, 255, 0.7 );\r\n\tposition: absolute;\r\n\tpadding: 5% 0;\r\n\tleft: 54%;\r\n\tmargin-top: 7%;\r\n}\r\n.point03 .content .txt_box .tit {\r\n\tcolor: #000;\r\n\tfont-weight: 600;\r\n\tfont-size: 30px;\r\n\tdisplay: inline-block;\r\n\tborder-bottom: 1px solid #000;\r\n}\r\n.point03 .content .txt_box .txt {\r\n\twidth: 70%;\r\n\tmargin: 0 auto;\r\n\tcolor: #000;\r\n\tfont-weight: 600;\r\n\tfont-size: 23px;\r\n\tmargin-top: 4%;\r\n}\r\n.point03 .content .txt_box .txt span {\r\n\twidth: 70%;\r\n\tmargin: 0 auto;\r\n\tcolor: #666;\r\n\tfont-weight: 400;\r\n\tfont-size: 19px;\r\n\tline-height: 1rem;\r\n}\r\n.point03 .table {\r\n\twidth: 75%;\r\n\tmargin: 0 auto;\r\n}\r\n.point03 table {\r\n\twidth: 100%;\r\n\tborder-collapse: separate;\r\n\tborder-spacing: 50px;\r\n\ttable-layout: inherit;\r\n}\r\n.point03 .table td {\r\n\tbackground-color: #efefef;\r\n\twidth: 30%;\r\n\tpadding: 7% 0;\r\n}\r\n.point03 .table .img {\r\n\twidth: 45%;\r\n\tmargin: 0 auto;\r\n}\r\n.point03 .table .txt p {\r\n\twidth: 85%;\r\n\tmargin: 0 auto;\r\n\tcolor: #000;\r\n\tfont-weight: 600;\r\n\tmargin-top: 5%;\r\n}\r\n.point03 .table .line {\r\n\twidth: 1px;\r\n\theight: 200px;\r\n\tborder: 1px solid red;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.point03 .Test_report {\r\n\twidth: 75%;\r\n\tmargin: 0 auto;\r\n}\r\n.point03 .Test_report h5 {\r\n\twidth: 80%;\r\n\tmargin: 0 auto;\r\n}\r\n.point03 .Test_report .group {\r\n\twidth: 100%;\r\n\tmargin-top: 5%;\r\n}\r\n.point03 .Test_report .group .box {\r\n\tdisplay: inline-block;\r\n\twidth: 45%;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.point03 .Test_report .group .box .img {\r\n\twidth: 100%;\r\n\tmargin: 0 auto;\r\n}\r\n.point03 .Test_report .group .box .txt p {\r\n\twidth: 85%;\r\n\tmargin: 0 auto;\r\n\tcolor: #000;\r\n\tfont-weight: 600;\r\n\tmargin-top: 3%;\r\n}\r\n.point03 .Test_report .mR3 {\r\n\tmargin-right: 3%;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n/**브랜드스토리**/\r\n.brand_story .point_tit {\r\n\tcolor: #000;\r\n\tfont-size: 3em;\r\n\tfont-weight: 700;\r\n\ttext-align: center;\r\n\ttext-transform: uppercase;\r\n\tmargin-top: 1%;\r\n}\r\n.brand_story .point_tit span { font-weight: 400;}\r\n.brand_story {\r\n\twidth: 96%;\r\n\theight: auto;\r\n\tborder: 1px solid #b1b1b1;\r\n\tmargin: 0 auto;\r\n\tmargin-top: 8%;\r\n\t/*margin-bottom: 8%;*/\r\n\tpadding-bottom: 2%;\r\n}\r\n.brand_story .rounded {\r\n  width: 200px;\r\n  background-color: #403025;\r\n  border:2px solid #000;\r\n  padding:0.1em 1em;\r\n  border-radius: 3em;\r\n  -moz-border-radius: 3em;\r\n  -webkit-border-radius: 3em;\r\n  color: #fff;\r\n  margin: 0 auto;\r\n  font-size: 1.2em;\r\n  line-height: 1.2em;\r\n  margin-top: -1.7%;\r\n  text-align: center;\r\n }\r\n\r\n.brand_story .content {\r\n\twidth: 93%;\r\n\tmargin: 0 auto;\r\n\ttext-align: left;\r\n\tmargin-top: 3%;\r\n\tmargin-bottom: 3%;\r\n}\r\n.brand_story .content .img, .brand_story .content .txt {\r\n\tdisplay: inline-block;\r\n\tvertical-align: top;\r\n}\r\n.brand_story .content .img {\r\n\twidth: 50%;\r\n}\r\n.brand_story .content .img img { width: 100%;}\r\n.brand_story .content .txt { \r\n\ttext-align: left;\r\n\twidth: 45%;\r\n\tmargin-left: 3%;\r\n\tword-break: keep-all;\r\n}\r\n.brand_story .brand_logo { width: 50%;}\r\n.brand_story .brand_logo img {width: 100%;}\r\n.brand_story .content .bd {\r\n\twidth: 8%;\r\n\theight: 2px;\r\n\tbackground-color: #666;\r\n\tmargin-top: 5%;\r\n}\r\n.brand_story .content .txt p {\r\n\tcolor: #333;\r\n\tfont-size: 22px;\r\n\tfont-weight: 400;\r\n\tmargin-top: 5%;\r\n}\r\n.brand_story .content .txt p.brand_story_txt {\r\n\tfont-weight: 600;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n/**각종인증사항**/\r\n.certifications {\r\n\twidth: 100%;\r\n\tpadding-top: 3%; /*10%*/\r\n\tpadding-bottom: 8%;\r\n\tmargin-bottom: 8%;\r\n}\r\n.certifications .certifi_info_tit {\r\n\twidth: 95%;\r\n\tmargin: 0 auto;\r\n}\r\n.certifi_info_subject {\r\n\tposition: relative;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.certifi_info_subject h2 {\r\n\tfont-size: 60px;\r\n\tfont-weight: 700;\r\n\ttext-align: center;\r\n\ttext-transform: uppercase;\r\n\tposition: absolute;\r\n\tcolor: #fff;\r\n\tmargin-top: 10%;\r\n\twidth: 100%;\r\n\tline-height: 60px;\r\n}\r\n.certifi_info_subject h2 span {\r\n\tfont-size: 30px;\r\n}\r\n.certifications img {\r\n\twidth: 100%;\r\n}\r\n.certifi_info_content img {\r\n}\r\n.certifi_01 {\r\n\twidth: 90%;\r\n\tmargin: 0 auto;\r\n\ttext-align: left;\r\n\tmargin-top: 5%;\r\n}\r\n.certifi_01 .certifi_01_img {\r\n\tdisplay: inline-block;\r\n}\r\n.certifications h5 {\r\n\tfont-size: 25px;\r\n\tfont-weight: 700;\r\n\tcolor: #000;\r\n}\r\n.certifications h6 {\r\n\tfont-size: 22px;\r\n\tfont-weight: 700;\r\n\tcolor: #333;\r\n\tmargin-top: 1.2%;\r\n\tdisplay: inline-block;\r\n}\r\n.certifications h6 span {\r\n\tborder-bottom: 1px solid #c1c1c1;\r\n}\r\n.certifications p {\r\n\tfont-size: 16px;\r\n\tcolor: #555;\r\n\tline-height: 24px;\r\n\tmargin-top: 1.5%;\r\n}\r\n.certifi_01_content {\r\n\tdisplay: inline-block;\r\n\twidth: 80%;\r\n\tmargin-left: 2.5%;\r\n\tvertical-align: top;\r\n}\r\n</style>\n<div class=\"Product_detail_page\">\n<div class=\"Product_key_img\">\n<div class=\"Product_key_txt\">\n<div class=\"Product_key_tit\">\n<p class=\"p01\">GCOOP Toothpaste</p>\n<p class=\"p02\">지쿱 치약</p>\n<h1>처음부터 끝까지 안전하고 깨끗하게</h1>\n<p class=\"p04\">무불소, 식물 유래 포뮬러로 어린아이부터 임산부까지 안전하고 깨끗하게 하는 것 뿐만 아니라 우리 가족의 건강을 지키는 것</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/GCOOP_Toothpaste/key.jpg\"/></div>\n\n<div class=\"point_content\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<div class=\"sub_head\">\n<div class=\"subheading\">\n<h5>effects</h5>\n</div>\n<img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/GCOOP_Toothpaste/main_icon.png\"/></div>\n\n<h3><span>효능 </span>효과</h3>\n<p>식약처가 인정한 식물 유래 포뮬러</p>\n<div class=\"icon_content\">\n<div class=\"group01\">\n<div class=\"sub_group\">\n<div class=\"icon_box\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/GCOOP_Toothpaste/img01.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"txt\">\n<p>1) 충치 예방, 구취를 제거한다.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"sub_group\">\n<div class=\"icon_box\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/GCOOP_Toothpaste/img02.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"txt\">\n<p>2) 심미효과를 높인다.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"sub_group\">\n<div class=\"icon_box\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/GCOOP_Toothpaste/img03.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"txt\">\n<p>3) 치은염, 치주염(치조농루)의 예방,<br/>\r\n치주질환의 예방, 잇몸질환의 예방.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"group01\">\n<div class=\"sub_group\">\n<div class=\"icon_box\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/GCOOP_Toothpaste/img04.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"txt\">\n<p>4) 구강 내를 청결히 유지한다.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"sub_group\">\n<div class=\"icon_box\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/GCOOP_Toothpaste/img05.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"txt\">\n<p>5) 구강 내를 상쾌하게 한다.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"sub_group\">\n<div class=\"icon_box\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/GCOOP_Toothpaste/img06.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"txt\">\n<p>6) 이를 희게 유지하고 튼튼하게 한다.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"key_point\">\n<div class=\"sub_head\">\n<div class=\"subheading\">\n<h5>effects</h5>\n</div>\n<img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/GCOOP_Toothpaste/main_icon.png\"/></div>\n\n<h3><span>제품 </span>특징</h3>\n<p>불소, 멘톨, 인공향, 인공색소를 제외하여 어린이부터 임산부까지 온 가족 사용이 가능함<br/>\r\n용량: 150g</p>\n<div class=\"main_content pd05\">\n<div class=\"main_content01\">\n<div class=\"contents_img\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/GCOOP_Toothpaste/img07.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"contents_txt\">\n<div class=\"sub_tit\">\n<div class=\"check\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/GCOOP_Toothpaste/check.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"tit\">식물유래성분 및 천연성분 99%</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"txt\">\n<p>- 화학성분에 길들여진 맛에는 처음 사용 시 밋밋함을 느낄 수도 있음<br/>\n<br/>\r\n- 마일드한 사용감과 거품력 좋으며, 양치 후 과일을 먹어도 과일 본연의 맛을 느낄 수 있음(No Juice 반응)</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"main_content pd05\">\n<div class=\"main_content01\">\n<div class=\"contents_img\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/GCOOP_Toothpaste/img08.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"contents_txt\">\n<div class=\"sub_tit\">\n<div class=\"check\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/GCOOP_Toothpaste/check.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"tit\">무첨가</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"txt\">\n<p>- 無불소, 無멘톨, 無인공향, 無광물성오일, 無합성방부제, 無색소, 無동물유래원료, 無SLS, 無PEG, 無사카린, 無마이크로비드, 無트리클로산, 無CMIT/MIT</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"main_content pd05 bdn\">\n<div class=\"main_content01\">\n<div class=\"contents_img\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/GCOOP_Toothpaste/img09.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"contents_txt\">\n<div class=\"sub_tit\">\n<div class=\"check\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/GCOOP_Toothpaste/check.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"tit\">안전한 성분(SAFETY)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"txt\">\n<p>- 처음부터 끝까지 안전하게 민감한 어린이부터 임산부까지 온 가족 사용이 가능함<br/>\n<br/>\r\n- 녹차, 캐모마일, 감초, 카렌듈라추출물 유기농 성분 함유</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"main_ingredient\">\n<div class=\"sub_head\">\n<div class=\"subheading\">\n<h5>Ingredients</h5>\n</div>\n<img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/GCOOP_Toothpaste/main_icon.png\"/></div>\n\n<h3>제품 <span>주요 성분</span></h3>\n<div class=\"content\">\n<div class=\"ingredient\">\n<div class=\"ingredient_img\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/GCOOP_Toothpaste/ingredient01.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"ingredient_txt\">\n<div class=\"ingredient_tit\">이산화규소(의약품 등급)</div>\n<p>미세하고 균일한 부드러운 최고급 연마제로 치아 표면과 잇몸 손상 및 자극 없이 효율적인 프라그 제거 효과 탁월, 치아 표면 침착 방지, 치아 얼룩제거에 도움이 되는 성분입니다.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"bdb\"> </div>\n<div class=\"ingredient_R\">\n<div class=\"ingredient_txt_R\">\n<div class=\"ingredient_tit\">피로인산나트륨(식품첨가물 등급)</div>\n<p>치태, 치석 침착을 예방하는 효과적인 피로인산 나트륨은 치아 미백에도 도움이 되는 성분입니다.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ingredient_img\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/GCOOP_Toothpaste/ingredient02.png\"/></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"bdb\"> </div>\n<div class=\"ingredient\">\n<div class=\"ingredient_img\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/GCOOP_Toothpaste/ingredient03.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"ingredient_txt\">\n<div class=\"ingredient_tit\">피리독신염산염(의약품 등급, 식품첨가물 등급)</div>\n<p>치주 질환 및 잇몸 염증 예방 효능에 도움이 되며 입안 염증 예방에 도움이 되는 성분입니다.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"sub_material\">\n<h3><span>제품 </span>부원료</h3>\n<div class=\"content\">\n<div class=\"group01\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/GCOOP_Toothpaste/img010.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"group02\">\n<div class=\"sub_group\">\n<div class=\"box\">\n<div class=\"box_img\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/GCOOP_Toothpaste/img011.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"box_txt\">\n<p>자일리톨</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"box\">\n<div class=\"box_img\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/GCOOP_Toothpaste/img012.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"box_txt\">\n<p>프로폴리스추출물</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"box\">\n<div class=\"box_img\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/GCOOP_Toothpaste/img013.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"box_txt\">\n<p>세이지엑스</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"sub_group\">\n<div class=\"box\">\n<div class=\"box_img\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/GCOOP_Toothpaste/img014.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"box_txt\">\n<p>녹차추출물</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"box\">\n<div class=\"box_img\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/GCOOP_Toothpaste/img015.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"box_txt\">\n<p>캐모마일추출물</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"box\">\n<div class=\"box_img\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/GCOOP_Toothpaste/img016.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"box_txt\">\n<p>자몽종자추출물</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"sub_group\">\n<div class=\"box\">\n<div class=\"box_img\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/GCOOP_Toothpaste/img017.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"box_txt\">\n<p>인삼엑스</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"box\">\n<div class=\"box_img\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/GCOOP_Toothpaste/img018.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"box_txt\">\n<p>감초엑스</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"box\">\n<div class=\"box_img\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/GCOOP_Toothpaste/img019.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"box_txt\">\n<p>알로에베라겔</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"point03\">\n<div class=\"sub_head\">\n<div class=\"subheading\">\n<h5>꼭!</h5>\n</div>\n<img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/GCOOP_Toothpaste/main_icon.png\"/></div>\n\n<h3>지쿱 치약<span>이여야 합니다.</span></h3>\n<p class=\"sub\">지쿱 치약은 불소, 멘톨, 인공향, 인공색소를 제외하여<br/>\r\n어린이부터 임산부까지 온 가족 사용이 가능합니다.</p>\n<div class=\"content\">\n<div class=\"txt_box\">\n<p class=\"tit\">지쿱 치약</p>\n<p class=\"txt\">불소, 멘톨, 인공향, 인공색소 및 기타 화학성분을 제외하여 온 가족이 안전하고 깨끗하게 사용하세요.<br/>\n<br/>\n<span>모든 건강은 입에서 시작한다고 합니다. 양치만 잘해도 건강관리를 잘 할 수 있습니다. 소중한 우리 아이부터 온 가족을 위해 안전하게 만들어 깨끗하게 사용하실 수 있도록 연구하여 담아냈습니다.</span></p>\n</div>\n<img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/GCOOP_Toothpaste/img020.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"table\">\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<div class=\"img\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/GCOOP_Toothpaste/img021.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"txt\">\n<p>식물유래성분 및 천연성분 99%</p>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td>\n<div class=\"img\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/GCOOP_Toothpaste/img022.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"txt\">\n<p>14가지 화학성분 무첨가</p>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<div class=\"img\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/GCOOP_Toothpaste/img023.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"txt\">\n<p>안전한 치약</p>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td>\n<div class=\"img\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/GCOOP_Toothpaste/img024.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"txt\">\n<p>불소 무첨가</p>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"Test_report\">\n<h5>+ USDA 유기농 원료 인증자료</h5>\n<div class=\"group\">\n<div class=\"box mR3\">\n<div class=\"img\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/GCOOP_Toothpaste/img025.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"txt\">\n<p>감초엑스(유기농)</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"box\">\n<div class=\"img\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/GCOOP_Toothpaste/img026.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"txt\">\n<p>녹차추출물(유기농)</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"group\">\n<div class=\"box mR3\">\n<div class=\"img\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/GCOOP_Toothpaste/img027.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"txt\">\n<p>카렌듈라엑스(유기농)</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"box\">\n<div class=\"img\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/GCOOP_Toothpaste/img028.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"txt\">\n<p>캐모마일추출물(유기농)</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"brand_story\">\n<div class=\"rounded\">BRAND STORY</div>\n<p class=\"point_tit\">브랜드 <span>스토리</span></p>\n<div class=\"content\">\n<div class=\"img\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/common_img/brand_story_gc02.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"txt\">\n<div class=\"brand_logo\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"brand_img02\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/common_img/brand_story_gc_logo.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"bd\"> </div>\n<p class=\"brand_story_txt\">일상생활에 효율적이고 편리한 제품을 공급하며 착한 소비를 지향하는 생활 전문 브랜드입니다.</p>\n<p>매일 사용하는 일상 제품은 언제 어디서든 믿고 안심할 수 있어야 합니다. 라이프스타일에 맞는 편리한 제품을 만나보세요.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"certifications\">\n<div class=\"certifi_info_tit\">\n<div class=\"certifi_info_subject\">\n<h2>각종 인증 사항<br/>\n<span>Certifications</span></h2>\n</div>\n<img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/common_img/certifications.png\"/></div>\n\n<div class=\"certifi_info_content\">\n<div class=\"certifi_01\">\n<div class=\"certifi_01_img\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/common_img/certifi_B_corp.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"certifi_01_content\">\n<div class=\"certifi_01_Detail\">\n<h5>비코프인증 획득!</h5>\n<h6><span>비코프인증(B-Corp Certified)</span>이란?</h6>\n<p>B-Corp은 비즈니스를 통해 사회 환경적 문제를 해결하고 사회에 긍정적인 영향을 끼치는 기업을 확대하기 위해서 2007년 BLab (미국비영리 조직)이 만든 글로벌 사회적 기업 인증 제도입니다.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"certifi_01\">\n<div class=\"certifi_01_img\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/common_img/certifi_family.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"certifi_01_content\">\n<div class=\"certifi_01_Detail\">\n<h5>가족친화우수기업 인증 획득!</h5>\n<h6><span>가족친화인증</span>이란?</h6>\n<p>가족친화제도를 모범적으로 운영하는 기업 및 공공기관에 대하여 심사를 통해 인증을 부여하는 제도입니다. 가족친화인증 기업은 근로자가 일에 집중하도록 하여 기업 생산성과 경쟁력 강화하고 출산율 제고, 고용 안정 등으로 국가경제 발전에 기여할 뿐 아니라 가족친화경영 확산을 통한 근로자와 가족 구성원의 삶의 질을 향상시키는 바른 기업 문화를 확산 시킵니다.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"#\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://vcshop.gcoop.com/images/icon_edu_materials.png\" style=\"width:220px;\"/></a>\n</div>\n</div>","info":[["품명 및 모델명","지쿱 치약"],["용량 또는 중량","150g"],["법에 의한 인증ㆍ허가 등을  받았음을 확인할 수 있는 경우 그에 대한 사항","의약외품"],["효능효과","1. 충치 예방, 구취를 제거한다.\n2. 심미효과를 높인다.\n3. 치은염, 치주염(치조농루)의 예방, 치주질환의 예방, 잇몸질환의 예방\n4. 구강 내를 청결히 유지한다.\n5. 구강 내를 상쾌하게 한다.\n6. 이를 희게 유지하고 튼튼하게 한다."],["용법용량(사용방법)","적당량을 칫솔에 묻혀 칫솔에 의해 치아를 닦는다."],["전성분","이산화규소,피로인산나트륨,피리독신염산염,소르비톨액,글리세린,소듐엔코코일엔메틸타우레이트액,덴탈타입실리카,셀룰로오스검,자일리톨,스테비올배당체,프로폴리스추출물,세이지엑스,녹차추출물,캐모마일추출물,자몽종자추출물,인삼엑스,알로에베라겔,감초엑스,염화나트륨,죽염,카렌듀라엑스,정제수"],["사용상 주의사항","1. 양치 용도 이외에는 사용하지 말 것\n2. 삼키지 않도록 주의하고, 사용 후에는 입안을 충분히 헹구어 낼 것\n3. 이 치약 사용으로 잇몸이나 입안이 상하는 등 이상이 발생하는 경우, 사용을 중지하고 의사 또는 치과 의사와 상의 할 것\n4. 만 6세 이하의 어린이가 사용할 경우 1회 완두콩 크기 정도의 소량의 치약을 사용하고  빨아 먹거나 삼키지 않도록 보호자의 지도하에 사용 할 것\n5. 만6세 이하의 어린이가 많은 양을 삼켰을 경우 즉시 의사 또는 치과 의사와 상의 할 것\n6. 만 6세 이하의 어린이의 손에 닿지 않는 곳에 보관 할 것"],["제조일자 및 사용기한","제품에 별도 표기"],["판매원","제너럴바이오㈜"],["제조국 또는 원산지","대한민국"],["제조자, 수입품의 경우 수입자를 함께 표기","㈜생잎제약"],["품질 보증 기준(A/S 관련사항)","본 상품의 품질보증 및 피해보상에 관한 사항은 관련 법률 및 공정거래위원회 고시 [소비자분쟁해결기준]에 따릅니다."],["소비자 상담관련 전화번호","지쿱 02-555-6009\n지쿱홈페이지(www.gcoop.com)하단 소비자상담센터 이용"]]}